join Zanele (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
- Is she all right?
	Hope: Is she all right?
	Zanele: She will be, I think, in a while.
	- What was the letter?
		Hope: What was the letter?
		Zanele: Not mine to say.
		Zanele: I read for perhaps a dozen people in this village. If I told you what was in one letter, I would be telling eleven other people that I might tell theirs.
		Zanele: So I do not. Not to anyone, and not about anything, including the pleasant ones.
